00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:48.160
I, um, I just wanted you to know that I did what you told me to do.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:52.440
Lois thinks that you're all about the oil up north now.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.440
Well done.

