So I guess wax on, wax off, or even now, right?

00:21:59.829 --> 00:22:02.829
I believe our arrangement has just begun.

00:22:02.829 --> 00:22:04.829
I want regular reports on Miss Lane's activities.

00:22:04.829 --> 00:22:06.829
Well, hey, I did what you said.

00:22:06.829 --> 00:22:08.829
I shouldn't have to spy for you, too. That's not fair.

00:22:08.829 --> 00:22:10.829
Life is rarely fair, Jimmy.

00:22:10.829 --> 00:22:12.829
Look, Lex.

00:22:12.829 --> 00:22:14.829
I would really like to help, but...

00:22:14.829 --> 00:22:16.829
Lying, it's just, uh...

00:22:16.829 --> 00:22:17.829
You know, it's not my thing.

00:22:17.829 --> 00:22:18.829
I mean, it's eating me up.

00:22:18.829 --> 00:22:19.829
It actually...

00:22:19.829 --> 00:22:21.829
It's making my stomach hurt.

00:22:21.829 --> 00:22:23.829
Well, it's never too late to learn a new skill.

00:22:23.829 --> 00:22:33.220
I can't do it.

00:22:33.220 --> 00:22:37.220
But trust me, I'm not gonna say a single word to anyone about your...

00:22:37.220 --> 00:22:40.630
Boiled, darling.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:41.630
Please, you gotta understand.

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:45.710
I can't spy on, my friend.

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:55.619
I respect your integrity, Jimmy.

00:22:55.619 --> 00:22:58.619
It took a lot to come here and lay your cards on the table.

00:22:58.619 --> 00:23:08.210
Now, if you'll step aside, I have a plane to catch.

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:10.650
You'll step aside.

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:15.329
You bet.

00:23:15.329 --> 00:23:16.329
Have a great trip, Lex.

00:23:16.329 --> 00:23:27.519
Kara, there's something wrong with Clark.

00:23:27.519 --> 00:23:31.519
He's convinced that if he destroys the fortress, then no one will be able to control him.

00:23:31.519 --> 00:23:33.519
We're at my apartment.

00:23:33.519 --> 00:23:36.150
I need you.

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.150
Where's Clark?

00:23:37.150 --> 00:23:39.150
He's, uh, right back here.

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:46.490
Why isn't it working?

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:48.490
Check the expiration date?

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:52.490
Kara, there's something seriously wrong with you.

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:53.490
It was the only way...

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:54.490
You lied to me.

00:23:54.490 --> 00:24:05.930
Clark's not here.

00:24:05.930 --> 00:24:06.930
Oh, God.

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:08.930
I'm impressed.

00:24:08.930 --> 00:24:09.930
I wouldn't.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:12.930
I've thought a member of your weak-willed species,

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:14.930
especially a friend of cowell's,

00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:17.930
could ever use kryptonite against his cousin.

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:25.079
Let me go.

00:24:25.079 --> 00:25:06.079
Always sticking your pretty little head where it doesn't belong.

00:25:06.079 --> 00:25:07.079
Sir?

00:25:07.079 --> 00:25:10.619
Tell the pilot to start the engines.

00:25:10.619 --> 00:25:12.619
I thought we were waiting for your guide.

00:25:12.619 --> 00:25:13.619
I don't need her.

00:25:13.619 --> 00:25:16.619
I'm not sure I should even trust her.

00:25:16.619 --> 00:25:21.509
But, sir, the last few teams have all disappeared.

00:25:21.509 --> 00:25:23.509
I believe I have everything I need to reach my destination.

00:25:23.509 --> 00:25:24.509
destination.

00:25:24.509 --> 00:25:28.109
This is meant to protect all humanity.

00:25:28.109 --> 00:25:30.109
It should protect me as well.

00:25:30.109 --> 00:25:32.109
But you don't know that, for sure, sir.

00:25:32.109 --> 00:25:34.109
It seems extremely dangerous.

00:25:34.109 --> 00:25:36.109
It's worth the risk.

00:25:36.109 --> 00:26:31.160
We leave now.

00:26:31.160 --> 00:26:32.160
I'm so sorry.

00:26:32.160 --> 00:28:20.920
Ever came back from Triptan?

00:28:20.920 --> 00:28:21.920
Did she?

00:28:21.920 --> 00:28:52.519
If we'd have done things my way,

00:28:52.519 --> 00:28:53.519
no one would have gotten hurt.

00:28:53.519 --> 00:28:56.799
This is all about revenge.

00:28:56.799 --> 00:29:01.490
It's a simple matter of self-preservation.

00:29:01.490 --> 00:29:05.349
When I couldn't kill you?

00:29:05.349 --> 00:29:07.349
I'm in control now.

00:29:07.349 --> 00:29:08.349
And you are released.

00:29:08.349 --> 00:29:10.349
Chloe, you release water.

00:29:10.349 --> 00:29:16.599
To save them would be to kill me now in cold blood,

00:29:16.599 --> 00:29:19.599
which goes against everything you stand for.

00:29:19.599 --> 00:29:22.599
You could never deliberately take another man's life.

00:29:22.599 --> 00:29:26.130
You're not a man.

00:29:26.130 --> 00:29:28.130
You're a machine.

00:29:28.130 --> 00:29:35.960
Kill me.

00:29:35.960 --> 00:29:37.960
I'll help.

00:29:37.960 --> 00:29:40.960
But you're in this near.

00:29:40.960 --> 00:29:42.960
And there's nothing you can do this.

00:29:42.960 --> 00:29:50.400
Stop you want I'll send her again.

00:29:50.400 --> 00:30:29.000
That's great news, Chloe.

00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:30.000
I'm glad you're okay.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.000
I'll call you after I check on Lana.

00:30:32.000 --> 00:30:44.329
Clark Kent?

00:30:44.329 --> 00:30:47.329
What happened? Is she okay?

00:30:47.329 --> 00:30:50.329
Miss Lang had a full recovery.

00:30:50.329 --> 00:30:52.329
Something of a miracle.

00:30:52.329 --> 00:30:55.329
Where is she? Can I see her?

00:30:55.329 --> 00:30:58.329
Oh, she's already checked out, but she wanted me to give you this.

00:30:58.329 --> 00:31:30.160
If I looked into your eyes, I never be able to say.

00:31:30.160 --> 00:31:34.160
We thought that we were meant to be together, Clark.

00:31:34.160 --> 00:31:40.630
But the truth is we were fooling ourselves.

00:31:40.630 --> 00:31:41.630
I need you.

00:31:41.630 --> 00:31:44.630
But the world needs you more.

00:31:44.630 --> 00:31:48.630
And as long as I'm in your life, I am holding you back.

00:31:48.630 --> 00:32:12.799
Please, more than you will ever know.

00:32:12.799 --> 00:33:15.680
You just got out of the hospital, Chloe, so take it slow, okay?

00:33:15.680 --> 00:33:18.680
You know, maybe I should, yeah, I'll carry up the stairs.

00:33:18.680 --> 00:33:22.680
Jimmy, we're climbing the stairs to the talon, not scaling the mountains of Tibet.

00:33:22.680 --> 00:33:23.680
I'm fine.

00:33:23.680 --> 00:33:24.680
How about some more?

00:33:24.680 --> 00:33:26.680
Oh, some tea. I pretty much mastered the tight type.

00:33:26.680 --> 00:33:30.029
Or maybe, you know what, you know,

00:33:30.029 --> 00:33:32.029
maybe not supposed to have caffeine,

00:33:32.029 --> 00:33:35.029
so maybe you just get some, um, some bottle water or some tap water.

00:33:35.029 --> 00:33:39.430
I know, some sparkling.

00:33:39.430 --> 00:33:42.430
Because, you know what, it matches your smile.

00:33:42.430 --> 00:33:46.430
Jimmy, I realize that I was the one that was just in the ICU,

00:33:46.430 --> 00:33:49.430
but you seem to be the one with marred motor skills.

00:33:49.430 --> 00:33:51.430
Are you okay?

00:33:51.430 --> 00:33:53.869
Yeah.

00:33:53.869 --> 00:34:11.820
Chloe, until tonight, I never thought that I would lose you.

00:34:11.820 --> 00:34:13.820
I mean, I mean,

00:34:13.820 --> 00:34:18.820
I know that we've been on again and off again and on again.

00:34:18.820 --> 00:34:23.739
But I figured even if we didn't end up together,

00:34:23.739 --> 00:34:28.820
I could be happy just known that you're in the world.

00:34:28.820 --> 00:34:37.519
But today, I realize that's not true.

00:34:37.519 --> 00:34:44.849
No, I mean, of course, I'm happy that you're in the world,

00:34:44.849 --> 00:34:50.179
but you mean so much to me, Chloe.

00:34:50.179 --> 00:34:56.849
And I want to spend the rest of our time in it together.

00:34:56.849 --> 00:35:14.570
It's all they had at the hospital gift shop, but

00:35:14.570 --> 00:35:18.880
I didn't want to wait.

00:35:18.880 --> 00:35:19.860
We can have breakfast at Tiffany's in the

00:35:19.880 --> 00:35:26.070
morning.

00:35:26.070 --> 00:35:27.070
Will you marry me?

00:35:27.070 --> 00:35:31.400
Hold on.

00:35:31.400 --> 00:35:32.400
This isn't right.

00:35:32.400 --> 00:35:33.400
What's going on?

00:35:33.400 --> 00:35:34.400
Hey!

00:35:34.400 --> 00:35:35.400
What do you guys think that you are?

00:35:35.400 --> 00:35:37.400
Department of Domestic Security.

00:35:37.400 --> 00:35:38.400
Jimmy!

00:35:38.400 --> 00:35:40.400
Chloe Sullivan, you're under arrest.

00:35:40.400 --> 00:35:42.400
Jimmy, call Clark.

00:35:42.400 --> 00:35:43.400
Get Clark!

00:35:43.400 --> 00:35:44.400
Clark!

00:35:44.400 --> 00:35:57.820
Are you here?

00:35:57.820 --> 00:36:04.550
Clark!

00:36:04.550 --> 00:36:07.550
Chloe was just arrested.

00:36:07.550 --> 00:36:09.550
What?

00:36:09.550 --> 00:36:11.550
Her habitual hacking caught Uncle Sam's eye,

00:36:11.550 --> 00:36:16.309
so I kind of went to Lexra out, but now he's holding it over my head.

00:36:16.309 --> 00:36:17.309
it over my head.

00:36:17.309 --> 00:36:18.309
You made a deal with Lex Luther?

00:36:18.309 --> 00:36:21.309
Look, I told him to get another lapdog, Clark.

00:36:21.309 --> 00:36:25.309
Then he just, he put her back on their most wanted list.

00:36:25.309 --> 00:36:30.940
She went from life support to life without parole, less than a day.

00:36:30.940 --> 00:36:31.940
Where's Lex now?

00:36:31.940 --> 00:36:32.940
Look, I don't know.

00:36:32.940 --> 00:36:35.940
I try to get in contact with him, but he's off jet-setting around the Arctic Circle.

00:36:35.940 --> 00:36:39.940
And I know it's not drilling oil, because he's gone way at his way to cover his tracks in the snow.

00:36:39.940 --> 00:38:41.579
I must admit, Clark, this is a big step up from the barn.

00:38:41.579 --> 00:38:43.579
Is that what you think, Lex?

00:38:43.579 --> 00:38:45.579
Lex.

00:38:45.579 --> 00:38:47.579
You don't understand?

00:38:47.579 --> 00:38:56.309
For the first time, I think I do.

00:38:56.309 --> 00:39:01.809
You see, you live among us as a mild-mannered farm boy.

00:39:01.809 --> 00:39:06.809
Secretly are a strange visitor from another planet plotting our demise.

00:39:06.809 --> 00:39:08.809
It's not what I'm doing at all.

00:39:08.809 --> 00:39:10.809
It's a brilliant disguise, Clark.

00:39:10.809 --> 00:39:12.809
You don't even need a mask.

00:39:12.809 --> 00:39:16.480
I'm not your enemy, Lex.

00:39:16.480 --> 00:39:21.079
I've never done anything to hurt you.

00:39:21.079 --> 00:39:22.079
You didn't trust me.

00:39:22.079 --> 00:39:24.360
With everything you had,

00:39:24.360 --> 00:39:29.360
everything you had, with everything you could do, did you ever think about what we could have accomplished together?

00:39:29.360 --> 00:39:32.360
I would have helped you become a hero.

00:39:32.360 --> 00:39:35.599
Have you ever thought of anyone but yourself?

00:39:35.599 --> 00:39:38.599
Right now, I'm doing this for the world.

00:39:38.599 --> 00:39:41.599
I have to protect the human race.

00:39:41.599 --> 00:39:44.599
This is my life. You have no right to control it.

00:39:44.599 --> 00:39:46.599
It's my birthright!

00:39:46.599 --> 00:39:53.599
After all my sacrifices, after all the pain, I finally understand.

00:39:53.599 --> 00:39:54.599
I was being...

00:39:54.599 --> 00:39:58.599
I was being prepared for a much greater destiny.

00:39:58.599 --> 00:40:01.599
Everything led me to this moment.

00:40:01.599 --> 00:40:03.599
And we're both here.

00:40:03.599 --> 00:40:04.599
We're in that moment.

00:40:04.599 --> 00:40:07.599
And what happens next is your choice.

00:40:07.599 --> 00:40:10.599
But no one is controlling you, Lex.

00:40:10.599 --> 00:40:12.599
No one is forcing you to do this.

00:40:12.599 --> 00:40:15.599
Who am I to turn my back on my fellow man?

00:40:15.599 --> 00:40:18.599
Especially after you turned your back on me.

00:40:18.599 --> 00:40:35.050
You hold the future of the entire planet in your hands.

00:40:35.050 --> 00:40:36.050
I'm here to take it back.

00:40:36.050 --> 00:40:37.050
Lex.

00:40:37.050 --> 00:40:41.400
You'll never threaten the world again.

00:40:41.400 --> 00:40:43.400
Calo.

00:40:43.400 --> 00:40:46.860
Lex, don't!

00:40:46.860 --> 00:41:15.840
I love you like a brother, Clark.

00:41:15.840 --> 00:41:17.840
But it has to end this way.

